    "intro_narrative": "You've infiltrated the underground server facility of the rogue megacorporation, Nexus Dynamics. The air is cold, filled with the hum of cooling fans and the blinking LEDs of massive server racks. Your objective is to initiate a system-wide override to expose their illegal surveillance network. The mainframe is heavily protected by a sequence of cryptographic and mathematical fail-safes. You must navigate through the complex network of interconnected terminals, deciphering hidden data, calculating synchronization metrics, and unlocking the final execution module before the internal security teams trace your location. The clock is ticking, and the grid's architecture is your only weapon.",
    "narrative_style": "techno_thriller"
  },
